      "context_text": "Hello Hi students The California State University where Professor Jonathan Young has invited to take a session on philosophy and religious studies Today, first of all, I would like to appreciate your curiosity to learn something about Jainism. I truly believe that Jainism is Not a religion But it is a philosophy and a way of living. Whenever we do any action It creates an image. an impression in your mind.",
