      "context_text": "Same thing happens with our life too. When we get angry, after getting angry the act is over, but It leaves behind an impression of getting angry which gets saved in the form of memories. So now Whenever you do any action of getting angry, it gets connected with this impression which is set in your mind. And hence, because of linking to the same impression, it opens the same file of getting angry and then you react. Now, tell me one thing. Then you boil water, its temperature increases, but slowly slowly after some time, it comes back to its normal room temperature, right? Because the real nature of the water is to be at room temperature.",
